# Weakens H's HandOffBound in this module's environment from the close's side: the
# close may record heads at or below a foreign record of the window, max-merged as
# production does, so that record lies at or above them. The core replays only to the recorded heads, and its live
# advance passes the record.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeCloseHeadUnderstated
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a close may record heads at or below a foreign record
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
    /\ \E h \in HeadsAbove({Foreign}) : hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, h)
--- REPLACE
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
\* MUTATION: the heads may be understated.
    /\ \E h \in 0..next : hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, h)
--- END
